# SJRC AutoReader — protocol examples
# Requires a REST client that supports .http files.
# Keep your filled-in copy out of git. Do not commit tokens.
#
# Side effects: start creates a session; heartbeat adds seconds; end closes it.
# Read docs/en/api.md and examples/README.md before running.

@base = https://api.sjrc.club
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@bookId = REPLACE_WITH_BOOK_ID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
@chapterId = REPLACE_WITH_CHAPTER_ID

### Read quota (seconds) — read-only
GET {{base}}/v1/client/reading-time
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Account details — read-only
GET {{base}}/v1/client/users/detail
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read a book's metadata — read-only
GET {{base}}/v2/client/books/{{bookId}}
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a reading session — creates state
# Response data.sessionId is required by every following call.
POST {{base}}/v1/client/reading-time/start
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "bookId": {{bookId}}
}

### Heartbeat — adds time (seconds, not milliseconds)
# The official client sends this every 3 seconds with time = 3.
PATCH {{base}}/v1/client/reading-time
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "time": 3
}

### Report a reading position — read-only metadata
POST {{base}}/v1/client/reading-pos
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "bookId": {{bookId}},
  "pos": {
    "chapterId": {{chapterId}},
    "chapterLocation": 0,
    "position": 1
  }
}

### End the session — use sessionId, not bookId
PATCH {{base}}/v1/client/reading-time/end
version: 2.9.0
x-current-platform: android
x-current-locale: zh-HK
x-auth-schema: CLIENT
authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
}
